# Idris 2 LSP support for the Zed editor.

Currently very barebones Zed extension for Idris 2 language support.
- Uses the Idris 2 treesitter grammar from https://github.com/kayhide/tree-sitter-idris
- Expects the [Idris 2 lsp server](https://github.com/idris-community/idris2-lsp) to be installed and available in the PATH as `idris2-lsp`

The grammar revision includes the identifier-recovery fix proposed in
https://github.com/kayhide/tree-sitter-idris/pull/16. It prevents keyword prefixes
and fragments inside names such as `interpret`, `mainLoop`, and `shutdown` from
being highlighted as keywords when editing incomplete declarations.
The grammar is pinned to the fix author's
fork while the upstream pull request is under review.
